message: "If you use these teaching materials in your work, please cite them as below."
title: "ComDraft: teaching materials for Communication and Document Drafting Skills (EC1103)"
abstract: >-
  ComDraft is a complete teaching package for a three-credit undergraduate course in
  business communication and document drafting, taught face to face at Vinh Long
  University of Technology Education. It holds five lecture decks covering the nature of
  communication, professional communication skills, communication in specific settings,
  business negotiation and the drafting of administrative and commercial documents; three
  computer-lab workbooks that take students from document formality through administrative
  documents to a full commercial document set; a bank of two hundred multiple-choice
  questions in lecturer and student editions, graded across three cognitive levels and
  supplied both as Word documents and as structured data; eight short revision and
  walkthrough videos; and eight diagrams drawn from code, including a labelled map of the
  nine formality components required by Decree 30/2020/ND-CP. Every slide carries a
  speaker-note script for use in Presenter View, and a single business case runs through
  the negotiation role-play, the document chain and both lab assignments so that students
  follow one continuous professional workflow.
